WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
The man who hasn't brushed his teeth
since Friday enters the room.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.620
What?

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:06.720
Not me.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.020
Said Ahlam, who's only walked
347 steps today.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:10.900
I cycled here.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.160
On an e-bike.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.360
Hatem got up twice last night
to go to the bathroom.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.660
How do they know all this?

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.440
Your health data reveals a lot.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.180
That's how I knew Faisal
got gassy yesterday.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.160
Next!

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.120
Wait. What's that in your hand?

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.440
No, no. Stop.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.200
Oh. Boring.
